# Binary assets. core.autocrlf is on for this machine, which means a fresh
# clone would otherwise rewrite LF to CRLF inside these files on checkout and
# break their byte offsets — fatal for a PDF's xref table.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary

# Source stays LF in the repo and in the working tree.
*.html  text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
